{#intro}
# Carve Showcase

A short document exercising core Carve constructs. It passes `carve lint` and
`carve fmt --check`, so it doubles as the skill's round-trip check and as the
one place the instruction SKILL.md gives agents is run on this repository.

Inline: /italic/, *bold*, /*bold italic*/, _underline_, ~strike~, =highlight=,
`code`, water is H{,2,}O and energy is E = mc{^2^}. See </#tables> below,
and a footnote here.[^note] An inline aside too.^[Inline footnotes number into
the same endnotes.]

## Lists

- unordered item
- item with two attached notes
+
> A note attached to the item above.
+
> A second note. Indented at the content column these two quotes would read
> as one, which is where the continuation marker is required.

- [ ] a task
- [x] a done task

1. first
2. second

